Subject: [PATCH 2/3] app: the app page in Korean, the legal notice line included
From: Office Kit
Date: 2026-10-18
Upstream: https://github.com/BRF-Tech/filex-office-editor (AGPL-3.0-or-later, Copyright (C) 2026 BRF Tech)
Base: v0.3.1 57dda3dae99af78eb26b3c64b69f1e3f711f0757 (the tag commit; the next main commit acc87f88da47 changes only README.md)
Apply: git -C <filex checkout> apply <this file>   (in order: 0001, 0002, 0003)
Modified: this patch changes filex-office-editor; see docs/office-editor-patches.md (Office Kit)

Office Kit: 앱 페이지 문구 한국어 (아래쪽 법적 고지 줄 포함). ko locale → ko 문구, "ko" 지역 → ko-KR.

The app page's own words in Korean for a `ko` locale, beside English and
Turkish: the notice under the editor (based on ONLYOFFICE Docs by
Ascensio System SIA, may have been modified, Docs version/build/source
tag, GNU AGPL v3, the source address, the trademark line), the opening,
failure and save messages. A plain `ko` locale gives the editor the
region ko-KR (was ko-KO). The "editor page reloaded" reason, an English
literal in main.ts, becomes a string in every language. The manifest
(filex-app.json) is left in English and Turkish.

